+  {
+    id: "allocation-123",
+    goalId: "goal-123",
+    accountId: "account-456",
+    sharePercent: 50,
+  },
+  // ... other allocations
+]);
+```
+
+#### `getAllocations(): Promise<GoalAllocation[]>`
+
+Gets goal allocations.
+
